"consectetur adipiscing elit”, looks like Latin because in its youth, "
"centuries ago, it was Latin."
msgstr ""
"The placeholder text, beginning with the line “Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, "
"consectetur adipiscing elit”, looks like Latin because in its youth, "
"centuries ago, it was Latin."

#: patterns/simple-text.php:27
msgid ""
"Richard McClintock, a Latin scholar from Hampden-Sydney College, is credited"
" with discovering the source behind the ubiquitous filler text. In seeing a "
"sample of lorem ipsum, his interest was piqued by consectetur—a genuine, "
"albeit rare, Latin word. Consulting a Latin dictionary led McClintock to a "
"passage from De Finibus Bonorum et Malorum (“On the Extremes of Good and "
"Evil”), a first-century B.C. text from the Roman philosopher Cicero."
msgstr ""
"Richard McClintock, a Latin scholar from Hampden-Sydney College, is credited"
" with discovering the source behind the ubiquitous filler text. In seeing a "
"sample of lorem ipsum, his interest was piqued by consectetur—a genuine, "
"albeit rare, Latin word. Consulting a Latin dictionary led McClintock to a "
"passage from De Finibus Bonorum et Malorum (“On the Extremes of Good and "
"Evil”), a first-century B.C. text from the Roman philosopher Cicero."

